    - target: {fileID: 7728007882734085703, guid: 11f7c75b80a19f242a126505b536d40b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'TRIDENT FISHING


        Grab the trident.


        Stab fish with
        its tip to catch them.


        Each attempt reduces its sharpness. Lower
        sharpness means a lower chance of success.


        When sharpness first
        reaches zero, the grindstone unlocks.


        Sharpen it with the grindstone. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
