      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "DOCK CONSTRUCTION\n\nClick a grid cell to build a dock.\n\nCost: 5
        Wood\n\nYour first dock unlocks the Lift Net Sandbox. Complete the practice
        to unlock normal Lift Net construction.\n\n\nLIFT NET CONSTRUCTION\n\nClick
        a dock to build a Lift Net.\n\nCost: 5 Wood + 5 Iron\n\nThe net catches fish
        automatically until full.\n\nThe bars show catch weight and durability. \n\nUse
        the hammer to repair the net before durability reaches zero, or it will break
        and disappear."
